# Route: guide 13 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Dwarf (1451
# of 1458 eligible quests, 164.1 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 33 to 35, 34
# quests, 3.4 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Darnassus, Thousand Needles, Dustwallow Marsh, The Barrens): near
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> Craftsmen's Terrace -> near Craftsmen's Terrace ->
# Craftsmen's Terrace -> The Shimmering Flats -> The Great Lift -> Theramore
# Isle -> Ratchet.
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): Encrusted Tail Fins (1107;
# Saltscale Warrior 35-36, Saltscale Oracle 36-37, Saltscale Tide Lord 37,
# Saltscale Forager 35-36, Saltscale Hunter 35-36); A Host of Evil (6626;
# Razorfen Battleguard 33-34, Razorfen Thornweaver 33-34, Death's Head Cultist
# 33-34).
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 5143 Tribal
# Leatherworking; 6607 Nat Pagle, Angler Extreme; 6624 Triage.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): In Search of Thaelrid (1198), Twilight Falls (1199), The
# Crone of the Kraul (1101), Gahz'rilla (2770), Tiara of the Deep (2846),
# Mortality Wanes (1142), Willix the Importer (1144), Blueleaf Tubers (1221),
# Blueleaf Tubers (1221), Deviate Eradication (1487), Deviate Eradication
# (1487), The Glowing Shard (6981).

